  "markdown_content": "## Incident Details\\n\\nThe incident occurred when filmmaker Anurag Kashyap made controversial remarks about the Brahmin community on social media. His statement \"Brahmins pe main mootunga...koi problem?\" (translating to a derogatory comment about Brahmins) drew immediate backlash from various sections of society.\\n\\nThe comments came in the wake of an ongoing debate surrounding the Phule controversy, though specific details about this related incident remain unclear.\\n\\nThis latest controversy adds to a series of contentious statements made by the filmmaker, known for his outspoken nature and often polarizing views on social issues.",
